  "text": "She linked the one she used. It's called Motili, and it was the only one I could find with all three in the same gummy. Everything else was just fiber with a different label. So I ordered it and changed nothing else. Same shot, same eating. Two gummies before breakfast with a glass of water. The first week, honestly, nothing happened. But by week two, I was sitting through a full dinner with my husband without that pressure building once. And by week six, I realized I hadn't thought about my stomach in days. That was me two months ago. Now, I get through dinner without planning my exit, and I'm not mapping my day around when I might feel okay. So if you're on a GLP-1, losing the weight, and still waking up every morning backed up and wondering why nobody warned you, this is why. I'll drop the link below. If ninety days in, it's not the difference you were hoping for, they give you all your money back",
